#. module: fitness
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:fitness.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b><u>Add Resources</u></b>: Easily add resources like classes or coaches to "
"your system."
msgstr ""
"<b><u>Adicionar recursos</u></b>: Adicione recursos como aulas ou "
"treinadores ao seu sistema com facilidade."

#. module: fitness
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:fitness.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b><u>Comprehensive Scheduling</u></b>: Plan and manage schedules, allowing "
"customers to book appointments directly from your website, manage classes "
"and sessions, and track attendance."
msgstr ""
"<b><u>Cronograma abrangente</u></b>: Planeje e gerencie cronogramas, "
"permitindo que os clientes agendem horários diretamente pelo site, gerenciem "
"aulas e sessões e acompanhem a presença."

#. module: fitness
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:fitness.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b><u>Customize Availability</u></b>: Set availability for different "
"resources, ensuring that your scheduling system is always up-to-date."
msgstr ""
"<b><u>Personalizar disponibilidade</u></b>: Defina a disponibilidade de "
"diferentes recursos, garantindo que seu sistema de agendamento esteja sempre "
"atualizado."

#. module: fitness
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:fitness.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b><u>Link to Courses</u></b>: Connect resources to specific courses that "
"can be either free or paid, depending on the user’s subscription status."
msgstr ""
"<b><u>Vincular a cursos</u></b>: Conecte recursos a cursos específicos que "
"podem ser gratuitos ou pagos, dependendo do status da assinatura do usuário."

#. module: fitness
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:fitness.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b><u>Website Integration</u></b>: Seamlessly integrate all these features "
"into your website, providing a unified experience for your customers to book "
"appointments, view class schedules, and manage subscriptions online."
msgstr ""
"<b><u>Integração ao Site</u></b>: Integre perfeitamente todos esses recursos "
"a seu site, proporcionando uma experiência unificada para que seus clientes "
"agendem compromissos, vejam os horários das aulas e gerenciem as assinaturas "
"on-line."

#. module: fitness
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:fitness.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Automated History:</b> If a customer replies to an email, the response is "
"automatically logged in the chatter on the right side of the screen. All "
"discussions regarding quotations, updates, and fine-tuning are attached, "
"making it easy for all team members to consult the communication history."
msgstr ""

#. module: fitness
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:fitness.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Centralized Orders:</b> Once confirmed, a quotation seamlessly converts "
"into a sales order. All quotations and sales orders are centralized within "
"the Sales app."
msgstr ""

